return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=n != 1;','language'=>'fy','project-id-version'=>'babilim-0.1.0-fy-babilim-0.1.0-fy-20261030T024152','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:26+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-30T06:25:26+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Babilim'=>'Babilim','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'Folt ûntbrekkende oersettingen oan foar de plugins en tema\'s dy\'t al op jo website ynstallearre binne.','Translations'=>'Oersettingen','Babilim Settings'=>'Babilim-ynstellingen','Settings'=>'Ynstellingen','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Jo hawwe gjin tastimming om dit te dwaan.','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Selektearje minder komponinten: maksimaal %1$d bewurkingen per run (jo selektearren %2$d).','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Dat komponint is net ynstallearre op dizze website, dus der kin gjin oersetting foar oanfrege wurde.','Already installed.'=>'Al ynstallearre.','Downloaded and installed.'=>'Downloade en ynstallearre.','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'Babilim is noch net ynskeakele foar dizze website.','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Der is gjin build beskikber om te downloaden foar dizze taalynstelling.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Weromset nei de foarige build.','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Weromset en rapportearre.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Weromset, mar it rapport koe net ferstjoerd wurde: %s','Removed.'=>'Fuortsmiten.','Translation requested.'=>'Oersetting oanfrege.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Dit komponint is al uploade. Babilim kontrolearret it no.','Upload cancelled.'=>'Upload annulearre.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Upload foltôge — oersetting oanfrege.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Dit komponint jout gjin ferzjenûmer op, dus der kin gjin oersetting foar oanfrege wurde.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'It ferzjenûmer fan dit komponint is langer as %d tekens, wat Babilim net ferwurkje kin, dus der kin gjin oersetting foar oanfrege wurde.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Der kin op dit stuit gjin oersetting foar dy taalynstelling op dizze website oanfrege wurde.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Tank. Jo rapport is ferstjoerd.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Dit rapport neamt gjin jildige plugin of tema en taalynstelling.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Kies in kategory foar dit rapport.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Dit rapport mist in jildige build om tsjin te rapportearjen.','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Dizze build is gjin build dy\'t dizze website op it stuit ken foar dit komponint/dizze taalregio.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'It fjild "%1$s" is te lang: it hat %2$d tekens en de limyt is %3$d. Der is neat ferstjoerd; koartsje it yn en besykje it opnij.','Original string'=>'Orizjineel tekst','String context'=>'Tekstkontekst','Current translation'=>'Aktuele oersetting','Suggested translation'=>'Foarsteld oersetting','Note (optional)'=>'Opmerking (opsjoneel)','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Wêr jo dit seagen (opsjoneel)','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'De Babilim-syngronisaasje is tydlik fertrage troch de tsjinst (tempobeheinend); it wurdt opnij besocht nei %s.','The locale you added is not valid: use a WordPress locale code such as ll_CC (letters, digits, underscore, hyphen or @, at most %d characters). Nothing was saved.'=>'De taalregio dy\'t jo tafoege hawwe is net jildich: brûk in WordPress-taalregiokoade lykas ll_CC (letters, sifers, ûnderstreek, koppelteken of @, maksimaal %d tekens). Der is neat bewarre.','Settings saved.'=>'Ynstellingen bewarre.','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'As dit ynskeakele is, wurdt by it deïnstallearjen ek de identiteit fan dizze website wiske. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan dizze website keppele is, kin dêrnei net automatysk wersteld wurde; jo moatte dan kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %s om dy werom te krijen.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim is ynsteld om de identiteit fan dizze website te wiskjen as de plugin fuortsmiten wurdt. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan dizze website keppele is, kin dan net automatysk wersteld wurde; jo moatte kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %s. Om de identiteit te behâlden, klikje jo op Annulearje, skeakelje jo "Alle Babilim-gegevens fuortsmite by it deïnstallearjen" út yn de Babilim-ynstellingen en deaktivearje jo opnij. Dochs deaktivearje?','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'%1$d website op dit netwurk is ynsteld om de Babilim-identiteit te wiskjen as de plugin fuortsmiten wurdt. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan dy website keppele is, kin dan net automatysk wersteld wurde; jo moatte kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %2$s. Om de identiteit te behâlden, klikje jo op Annulearje, skeakelje jo "Alle Babilim-gegevens fuortsmite by it deïnstallearjen" út yn de Babilim-ynstellingen fan dy website en deaktivearje jo opnij. Dochs deaktivearje?' . "\0" . '%1$d websites op dit netwurk binne ynsteld om harren Babilim-identiteit te wiskjen as de plugin fuortsmiten wurdt. De betelle lisinsje dy\'t oan dy websites keppele is, kin dan net automatysk wersteld wurde; jo moatte kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %2$s. Om de identiteiten te behâlden, klikje jo op Annulearje, skeakelje jo "Alle Babilim-gegevens fuortsmite by it deïnstallearjen" út yn de Babilim-ynstellingen fan elke website en deaktivearje jo opnij. Dochs deaktivearje?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Dit netwurk hat te folle websites om se ien foar ien te kontrolearjen, en guon dêrfan binne mooglik ynsteld om harren Babilim-identiteit te wiskjen as de plugin fuortsmiten wurdt. De betelle lisinsje fan sa\'n website koe dan net automatysk hersteld wurde; jo moatte dan kontakt opnimme mei de Babilim-stipe op %s. Om de identiteiten te behâlden, klikje op Annulearje, ferwiderje it finkje by "Alle Babilim-gegevens fuortsmite by it deïnstallearjen" yn de Babilim-ynstellingen fan elke website, en deaktivearje opnij. Dochs deaktivearje?','Open Babilim settings'=>'Babilim-ynstellingen iepenje','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim koe dizze website net kontrolearje, dus der wurdt neat downloade of ynstallearre.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'De tsjinst koe jo website net berikke. In firewall, befeiligingsplugin of host-regel blokkearret it fersyk wierskynlik; stean fersiken ta oan /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Jo website die te lang oer it antwurdzjen. Probearje it letter opnij en kontrolearje dat jo host net te stadich of oerbelêste is.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Jo website antwurde, mar net mei wat ferwachte waard. De REST API wurdt mooglik herskreaun troch in oare plugin, of dat einpunt is yn de cache opslein; slút /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge út fan caching en herskriuwen.','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Kontrolearje dat jo website fan it ynternet út berikber is en probearje it dan opnij.','Re-verify'=>'Opnij kontrolearje','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Dizze website is grutter as de tsjinst yn ien synchronisaasje akseptearret, dus guon items binne weilitten: %1$d komponinten en %2$d taalregio\'s.','This site is verified.'=>'Dizze website is kontrolearre.','Registration restarted.'=>'Registraasje is opnij start.','Sync complete.'=>'Synchronisaasje foltôge.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim is dizze website oan it ynskeakeljen en kontrolearjen… Laad dizze side opnij of wachtsje oant de pland kontrôle klear is.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim koe it ynskeakeljen net foltôgje (%1$s): %2$s','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'In host dy\'t mar ien PHP-fersyk tagelyk ferwurket, kin dizze stap net foltôgje.','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim is ynskeakele: dizze website is kontrolearre en %d komponint is fûn.' . "\0" . 'Babilim is ynskeakele: dizze website is kontrolearre en %d komponinten binne fûn.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim is útskeakele. Der wurdt neat mear ferstjoerd; al ynstallearre oersettingen bliuwe wurkje.','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Oanfoljende oersettingsyndeks opnij opboud.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Opskjinjen foltôge: %d bestân fuortsmiten.' . "\0" . 'Opskjinjen foltôge: %d bestannen fuortsmiten.','Removed %d installed component.'=>'%d ynstallearre komponint fuortsmiten.' . "\0" . '%d ynstallearre komponinten fuortsmiten.','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'Automatyske ynstallaasjes steane no út; set se yn de ynstellingen wer oan as jo se wolle.','Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each.'=>'Babilim fynt de plugins en tema\'s op dizze website dy\'t gjin oersetting foar jo taal hawwe en ynstallearret der ien foar elk.','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Talen fûn op dizze website: %s.','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. After that, new translations and updates are installed automatically (on the free plan, only for plugins and themes that already use a free slot).'=>'Beskikbere oersettingen kinne mei ien klik ynstallearre wurde, en ûntbrekkende kinne oanfrege wurde. Dernei wurde nije oersettingen en updates automatysk ynstallearre (by it frij abonnemint allinnich foar plugins en tema\'s dy\'t al in frije plak brûke).','The free plan covers a limited number of plugins and themes; your exact quota is shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'It frije abonnemint omfettet in beheind oantal plugins en tema\'s; jo krekte kwota wurdt yn de Ynstellingen toand nei it ynskeakeljen fan Babilim.','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Wat der ferstjoerd wurdt as jo Babilim ynskeakelje','Enabling…'=>'Ynskeakelje…','Enable Babilim'=>'Babilim ynskeakelje','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'Troch op Ynskeakelje te klikken, stimme jo yn mei it ferstjoeren fan de hjirboppe neamde ynformaasje nei Babilim.','Check again now'=>'No opnij kontrolearje','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'Babilim hat sûnt jo lêste besite %d oersetting automatysk ynstallearre.' . "\0" . 'Babilim hat sûnt jo lêste besite %d oersettingen automatysk ynstallearre.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim is dizze website oan it ynskeakeljen en kontrolearjen… (lêste poging: %s)','Check again'=>'Opnij kontrolearje','No components synced yet.'=>'Noch gjin komponinten synchronisearre.','%d succeeded'=>'%d slagge' . "\0" . '%d slagge','%d skipped'=>'%d oerslein' . "\0" . '%d oerslein','%d failed'=>'%d mislearre' . "\0" . '%d mislearre','%d not yet tried'=>'%d noch net probearre' . "\0" . '%d noch net probearre','Bulk %s:'=>'Bulk %s:','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s neat te dwaan.','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s.','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s (%2$s): %3$s','Continuing…'=>'Trochgean…','Continue next batch (%d left)'=>'Folgjende batch trochgean (%d oer)','Search components'=>'Komponinten sykje','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'Dit binne de talen dy\'t dizze side brûkt. Jo kinne se wizigje yn %s.','Upload this component?'=>'Dizze komponint oploadzje?','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'Der is gjin oplaad dy\'t wachtet op befêstiging.','Back'=>'Werom','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'Om dizze komponint te oersetten hat Babilim de boarne nedich.','The entire plugin or theme directory of %1$s (version %2$s) will be uploaded to Babilim.'=>'De folsleine plugin- of temamap fan %1$s (ferzje %2$s) wurdt nei Babilim opladen.','If that directory contains keys, logs or customer data, they will be uploaded too. The service removes common sensitive files (configuration, environment, database dumps, logs, keys) but cannot guarantee it finds everything.'=>'As dy map kaaien, logboeken of klantgegevens befettet, wurde dy ek opladen. De tsjinst ferwideret gewoane gefoelige bestannen (konfiguraasje, omjouwing, databankdumps, logboeken, kaaien), mar kin net garandearje dat alles fûn wurdt.','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'De oplaad wurdt bewarre oant jo Babilim freegje him te wiskjen.','It is stored by the service\'s hosting provider and processed by AI models to produce the translation.'=>'It wurdt bewarre troch de hostingprovider fan de tsjinst en ferwurke troch AI-modellen om de oersetting te meitsjen.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'De orizjinele tekst en de oersettingen dy\'t dêrfan makke binne, wurde beskikber steld oan oare websteden dy\'t deselde ferzje ynstallearje.','By continuing you confirm that you have the right to upload this component.'=>'Troch troch te gean befêstigje jo dat jo it rjocht hawwe om dizze komponint op te laden.','Upload and request'=>'Oplade en oanfreegje','Uploading…'=>'Oplade…','Cancel'=>'Annulearje','Uploading'=>'Oplade','There is no upload in progress.'=>'Der is gjin upload oan \'e gong.','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'Diel %1$d fan %2$d oplade…','Continue'=>'Trochgean','Confirm'=>'Befêstigje','Remove'=>'Ferwiderje','Roll back'=>'Weromdraaie','Nothing to confirm.'=>'Neat om te befêstigjen.','Choose a language'=>'Kies in taal','Roll back and report'=>'Weromdraaie en melde','Report a problem'=>'In probleem melde','Nothing to choose.'=>'Neat om te kiezen.','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s: %2$s. Kies de taal.','Supplementary translations'=>'Oanfullende oersettingen','Each component\'s own contribution to each locale\'s shared default-domain supplement.'=>'De eigen bydrage fan elke komponint oan de dielde oanfolling foar it standertdomein fan elke locale.','Component'=>'Komponint','Language'=>'Taal','Included in index'=>'Opnommen yn yndeks','Entries'=>'Items','Conflicting keys'=>'Konflikterjende kaaien','Yes'=>'Ja','No — component inactive'=>'Nee — komponint ynaktyf','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'Nee — de ynstallearre ferzje wykt ôf fan de aktive ferzje','No — component removed'=>'Nee — komponint fuortsmiten','No'=>'Nee','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'Dit kin allinnich dien wurde troch in netwurkbehearder, om\'t dit fertalingsbestannen wizigret dy\'t dield wurde troch alle websites yn dit netwurk.','Babilim could not finish verifying this site (the service could not reach it back). Registration is paused.'=>'Babilim koe it kontrolearjen fan dizze website net foltôgje (de tsjinst koe de website net werom berikke). De registraasje is op pauze set.','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Dizze website hat al in aktive registraasje dy\'t net mear automatysk werstelle wurde kin.','Restart registration'=>'Registraasje opnij starte','Babilim settings'=>'Babilim-ynstellingen','General'=>'Algemien','Advanced'=>'Avansearre','Languages'=>'Talen','Automatic installs'=>'Automatyske ynstallaasjes','Install available translations automatically'=>'Beskikbere fertalingen automatysk ynstallearje','On the free plan, only components that already use one of your free slots are installed automatically, so no new slot is taken.'=>'Op it frije abonnemint wurde allinnich komponinten automatysk ynstallearre dy\'t al ien fan jo frije plakken brûke, sadat der gjin nij plak ynnommen wurdt.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Dizze website is diel fan in multisite-netwurk, dat nije fertalingen net automatysk ynstallearret. Fertalingen dy\'t al ynstallearre binne, wurde noch wol bywurke.','Custom overrides'=>'Oanpaste oerskriuwingen','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Bewarje myn eigen fertalingsoerskriuwingen by it folslein wiskjen of it deïnstallearjen fan dizze plugin.','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'Fertalingsbestannen dy\'t jo yn %s pleatse, hawwe altyd foarrang op dy fan Babilim. Se wurde bewarre, útsein as jo dit fakje útskeakelje.','Uninstall'=>'Deïnstallearje','Delete all Babilim data on uninstall'=>'Alle Babilim-gegevens fuortsmite by it deïnstallearjen','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Standert út: by it fuortsmiten fan de plugin bliuwt de identiteit fan dizze website bewarre, sadat in opnij ynstallearjen dy opnij brûke kin.','Account'=>'Account','Save changes'=>'Wizigingen bewarje','Disable Babilim'=>'Babilim útskeakelje','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Ynstallearre fertalingen bliuwe bewarre, mar der wurde gjin kontrôles of downloads mear útfierd.','Disable Babilim? Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Babilim útskeakelje? Ynstallearre fertalingen bliuwe bewarre, mar der wurde gjin kontrôles of downloads mear útfierd.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Dizze website is noch net registrearre by Babilim.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Dizze website hat al in lisinsje. Laad de side opnij.','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'Ofrekkenjen is op dit stuit net beskikber foar dizze website.','Could not start checkout: %s'=>'Koe it ôfrekkenjen net starte: %s','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim is net ynskeakele.','Not registered yet'=>'Noch net registrearre','Not verified'=>'Net ferifiearre','Verified'=>'Ferifiearre','Status'=>'Status','Licensed'=>'Lisinsjearre','Partner'=>'Partner','Free'=>'Fergees','License'=>'Lisinsje','Upgrade this site'=>'Dizze side opwurdearje','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Ienmalige oankeap foar dizze side: %1$s %2$s. Omfettet alle takomstige oersettingsupdates. De betelling wurdt ferwurke troch Paddle yn in nij ljepblêd.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Dit jout in nije herstelkoade út en de foarige hâldt op te wurkjen. Trochgean?','Show a new restore code'=>'In nije herstelkoade toane','rc_…'=>'rc_…','Restore code'=>'Herstelkoade','Restore purchase'=>'Oankeap werombringe','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'Hawwe jo earder in lisinsje foar dit domein kocht? Fier de herstelkoade yn dy\'t jo by it ôfrekkenjen krigen hawwe.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Dat liket net op in herstelkoade.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Dizze herstelkoade is foar dizze side net werkend.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Te folle besykjen. Besykje it moarn opnij.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Dizze side moat earst ferifiearre wurde.','Could not restore the purchase: %s'=>'De oankeap koe net werombrocht wurde: %s','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Oankeap werombrocht. Dizze side is no lisinsjearre.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Dizze side hat gjin oankeap om in koade foar te toanen.','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'In nije werstelkoade koe net toand wurde: %s','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Jo nije werstelkoade: %s. Bewarje him op in feilich plak — de foarige koade wurket net mear.','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Wat der ferstjoerd wurdt as Babilim dizze side kontrolearret','(detected)'=>'(detektearre)','No language is managed yet.'=>'Der wurdt noch gjin taal beheard.','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim foeget oersettings ta foar elke taal dy\'t hjir oanfinkt is.','Add another language'=>'Noch in taal tafoegje','Choose a language…'=>'Kies in taal…','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'De folsleine WordPress.org-lokaallist koe net fan de tsjinst laden wurde, dus no kin gjin oare taal tafoege wurde.','Theme'=>'Tema','Plugin'=>'Plugin','Free quota'=>'Frij kwota','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)','Supplementary translation index'=>'Oanfoljende oersettingsyndeks','Built'=>'Boud','Included'=>'Opnommen','Excluded'=>'Útsletten','Already in WordPress core'=>'Al yn de WordPress-kearn','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Ûnderhâld fan oanfoljende oersettingen','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'De ûnderhâldsstatus is op it stuit net beskikber.','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'In opskjinjen is pauzearre op %1$s: %2$s. Der is neat wiske.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'Lêste opskjinjen op %1$s: %2$d nij markearre, %3$d bestân(en) wiske, %4$d record(s) fuortsmiten.','No cleanup has run yet.'=>'Der is noch gjin opskjinjen útfierd.','A translation-index write conflicted with another request on %1$s (%2$s) and was not applied; the 