ress — continue or cancel'=>'Upload dwaande — trochgean of annulearje','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Pland, wachtet op ferwurking','Translating…'=>'Oersette…','Translation failed'=>'Oersetting mislearre','Free quota used'=>'Frij kwota brûkt','Needs a paid license'=>'Hat in betelle lisinsje nedich','Not supported'=>'Net stipe','Status unknown'=>'Status ûnbekend','translation statusInstalled'=>'Ynstallearre','Update available'=>'Fernijing beskikber','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Fuortsmiten nei in mislearre yntegriteitskontrôle','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, nije ferzje is pland','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, nije ferzje is pland','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, de nije ferzje wurdt oerset…','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, de nije ferzje wurdt oerset…','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %1$s, dizze side hat %2$s','Installed · built for %s'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s','Installed · built for a different version'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, nije ferzje mislearre','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, nije ferzje mislearre','Installed · built for %s, new version needs a paid license'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, nije ferzje freget in betelle lisinsje','Installed · built for a different version, new version needs a paid license'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, nije ferzje freget in betelle lisinsje','Installed · built for %s, free quota used'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar %s, frij kwota brûkt','Installed · built for a different version, free quota used'=>'Ynstallearre · boud foar in oare ferzje, frij kwota brûkt','translation statusAvailable'=>'Beskikber','Installed · %s'=>'Ynstallearre · %s','Available · %s'=>'Beskikber · %s','Update'=>'Bywurkje','Download'=>'Downloade','Updating…'=>'Bywurkje…','Downloading…'=>'Downloade…','Retry request'=>'Fersyk opnij besykje','Request newer translation'=>'Nijere oersetting oanfreegje','Request translation'=>'Oersetting oanfreegje','Requesting…'=>'Oanfreegje…','Requesting a translation uses one of your free slots, unless this component already uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back.'=>'Foar it oanfreegjen fan in oersetting wurdt ien fan jo frije plakken brûkt, útsein as dizze komponint der al ien brûkt. In mislearre oersetting jout it plak net werom.','If this component does not use one of your free slots yet, requesting a translation uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back. Continue?'=>'As dizze komponint noch gjin fan jo frije plakken brûkt, wurdt der ien brûkt by it oanfreegjen fan in oersetting. In mislearre oersetting jout it plak net werom. Trochgean?','No plugins or themes found.'=>'Gjin plugins of tema\'s fûn.','Clear filters'=>'Filters wiskje','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Gjin komponinten komme oerien mei dizze filters. %s','Select all'=>'Alles selektearje','All'=>'Alles','Available'=>'Beskikber','Updates'=>'Bywurkingen','Requestable'=>'Oan te freegjen','Installed'=>'Ynstallearre','Plugins'=>'Plugins','Themes'=>'Tema\'s','All languages'=>'Alle talen','%d to install'=>'%d te ynstallearjen' . "\0" . '%d te ynstallearjen','Language:'=>'Taal:','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'Massa-aksjes jilde foar elke oerienkommende taal fan elke selektearre komponint.','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'Massa-aksjes jilde allinnich foar de selektearre taal fan elke selektearre komponint.','Version %s'=>'Ferzje %s','Theme · %s'=>'Tema · %s','Plugin · %s'=>'Plugin · %s','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'De %2$s-oersetting fan %1$s fan dizze side fuortsmite?','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'De %2$s-oersetting fan %1$s weromdraaie nei de foarige build?','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'De registraasje-útdaging hat net de ferwachte foarm.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Dat is gjin jildige build-identifikator.','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Skriuwen bûten de Babilim-taalbestânmap wurdt wegere.','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'Kin it downloade pakket net nei skiif skriuwe.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Unferwachte HTTP-antwurd %d.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'De URL fan dizze side, sadat de tsjinst kontrolearje kin dat jo de eigener binne.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Jo WordPress-ferzje, om kompatibele oersettingsbestannen te leverjen.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Jo PHP-ferzje, foar kompatibiliteit.','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'De eigen ferzje fan dizze plugin, sadat de tsjinst jo sizze kin om by te wurkjen as it te âld is om mei te praten.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'De ynstelde taal- en regio-ynstelling fan dizze side.','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'Elke taal- en regio-ynstelling dy\'t op dizze side brûkt wurdt (de ynstelling fan de side, ynstallearre taalpakketten, ynstellingen fan brûkers en alle ynstellingen dy\'t jo hânmjittich tafoegje). Gjin taal- en regio-ynstelling wurdt oars behannele as in oare.','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(in iepenbiere kaai foar dizze side oanmakke)','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'De iepenbiere ynstallaasjekaai fan dizze side, brûkt om te bewizen dat fersiken echt fan dizze side komme. Allinnich de iepenbiere helte wurdt ea ferstjoerd.','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'Elke ynstallearre plugin/tema: de slug, ferzje, tekstdomein(en), oft it in wp.org-fermelding is, de eigen bondele taal- en regio-ynstellingen en foar hokker taal- en regio-ynstellingen jo al in Babilim-oersetting ynstallearre hawwe.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: that component\'s entire directory, as a zip.'=>'Allinnich as jo in upload befêstigje foar in plugin of tema dat net op WordPress.org stiet: de hiele map fan dy komponint, as zip.','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(allinnich algemiene koades en koördinaten)','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'Oant 20 diagnostyske eveneminten yn ôfwachting (bygelyks in bestân dat syn yntegriteitskontrôle net trochkaam), elk allinnich in koade, komponint en taal- en regiokoade, en nea tekenrigelynhâld of oersetten tekst.','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Ûnfeilige taal- en regiokoade: %s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifest net beskikber: %s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'Kin aktive komponinten net bepale; de besteande gearfoege yndeks is net wizige.','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'Kin ynstallearre plugins/tema\'s net bepale; opskjinjen oerslein, der is neat wiske.','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Opskjinjen ôfbrutsen sûnder wat te ferwêzen: %s.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'De opskjinjen is útfierd, mar guon fan de wizigingen koene net yn de oersettingsyndeks fêstlein wurde; de folgjende opskjinjen besiket it opnij.','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'De gearfoege yndeks foar \'%s\' is op \'e nij opboud, mar de oersettingsyndeks koe it net fêstlizze; de folgjende op\'e-nij-opbou besiket it opnij.','Could not write the staged merged index.'=>'Kin de klearsette gearfoege yndeks net skriuwe.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'It oantal opnij ynlêzen items kaam net oerien mei de opboude yndeks.','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until the next successful rebuild.'=>'Kin de gearfoege yndeks foar \'%s\' net op syn plak sette; de foarige levere yndeks (as dy der wie) is fuortsmiten yn stee fan dy mar foar in part bywurke te litten. Foar dizze taal- en regio-ynstelling wurdt gjin oanfolling foar it standertdomein levere oant de folgjende suksesfolle weropbou.','Could not open zip: %s'=>'Kin zip net iepenje: %s','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'De zip befettet gjin manifest.json.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'manifest.json yn de zip is gjin jildige JSON.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'\'%s\' yn manifest.json komt net oerien mei de ferwachte wearde.','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'Der rint al in oare ynstallaasje; besykje it oer in momint opnij.','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'Gjin jildige server_build_id: %s','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'It soarte \'%1$s\' fan it pakketmanifest komt net oerien mei it frege soarte \'%2$s\'.',